 "about_text": "induction gallery is a Los Angeles gallery founded and directed by artist and curator John Zinonos. Located at 672 S. La Fayette Park Place in the city's Westlake area, the space works by appointment and presents a roster of emerging and mid-career artists working across painting, sculpture, ceramics, photography, collage, and new media. The program reflects Zinonos's own multidisciplinary curatorial interests, bringing together Los Angeles-based and out-of-state artists whose practices engage material experimentation, personal narrative, and technology-driven or ecological themes.",
